==German==

===Verb===
{{de-verb|mitgehen_lassen<lässt#ließ,lassen>}}

# {{lb|de|idiomatic}} to [[steal]], to [[pilfer]] {{i|especially while being some place for some other purpose}}
#: {{ux|de|Letztens hab ich im Laden zwei CDs '''mitgehen lassen'''.|I recently '''pilfered''' two CD's in the store.}}
# to [[take]] (something) {{i|possibly because one forgets to put it back}}
#: {{ux|de|Er hat wieder mal mein Feuerzeug '''mitgehen lassen'''.|Once again he '''took''' my lighter.}}

